abstract: >-
  An ab initio machine learning Density Functional Theory (CHGNet + ASE + Pymatgen) multi-physics 
  solver and materials screening framework designed to optimize tokamak plasma-facing components, 
  non-ferromagnetic structural walls, eutectic breeder blankets, and high-field magnetic coils.
